XZ Utils
XZ Utils is free general-purpose data compression software with a high compression ratio.

license: public domain/LGPLv2.1
license url: https://github.com/tukaani-project/xz/blob/master/COPYING

The selected release is defined in `projects/versions.mk`.

Building
- XZ Utils builds without problems, however autogen runs into problems specific
  to VirtualBox's file system for shared directories, so it needs to be run in a
  temporary location.
- We need to ensure built executables are position independent
